	SSL PRIME: Mission, Vision, and Roadmap
Mission Statement

SSL PRIME is dedicated to revolutionizing human transportation on Earth and beyond by developing sustainable energy systems, plasma propulsion technologies, and interstellar spacecraft capable of reaching Alpha Centauri within one lifetime. Our goal is to combine engineering, astrophysics, and IT expertise to solve global energy challenges and pioneer advanced space exploration.

